Bundle-Name: Event Atlas Model Inference Chat Completion Adapter
Bundle-Description: Binds model inference's ChatCompletion port to a Fennec AI \
 ChatCompletionService, and reads the agent's answer out of the response's content blocks. \
 The whole reason it is a bundle of its own: it is the only place that depends on an AI \
 stack, so a runtime without one simply does not deploy it - and the inference bundle stays \
 free of both that dependency and of EMF.

-workingset: SensiNact

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.eclipse.fennec.event.atlas.model.inference;version=snapshot,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.ai.chat.completion.api;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.ai.apis.meta.model;version=latest,\
	org.osgi.util.promise;version=latest
